  "excerpt": "Optimiza tu gestión financiera personal con tetse: ahorro, presupuesto y seguimiento automático para tus metas.",
  "image": "/imagens/img-post/30.png",
  "content": "<style>@keyframes ctaBounce{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(-6px)}}50%{box-shadow:0 28px 80px rgba(132,192,2,0.9),0 10px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.16)}}@keyframes ctaShine{0%{background-position:200% center}100%{background-position:-200% center}}@keyframes ctaPulse{0%,100%{transform:scale(1)}50%{transform:scale(1.03)}}@media(max-width:640px){.thecta{font-size:28px!important;min-height:66px!important;padding:0.9em 1.1em!important;border-radius:14px!important}.thecta svg{width:32px!important;height:32px!important}}</style>\n<p>Optimiza el <strong>cuidado de mascotas</strong> con tetse, la plataforma que simplifica su bienestar. Descubre una gestión sin igual.</p>\n<p>Esta solución de <strong>bienestar animal</strong> se distingue por su enfoque integral. Haz clic para transformar su vida hoy.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:18px 0 14px\"><a href=\"/p/tetse-la-innovacion-para-el-bienestar-de-tu-mascota\" class=\"thecta\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:0.35em;padding:1.1em 1.4em;background:linear-gradient(110deg,#84C002 40%,#96d214 50%,#84C002 60%);background-size:200% 100%;color:#fff;border-radius:16px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.8px;width:100%;font-size:30px;text-decoration:none;line-height:1;min-height:64px;animation:ctaBounce 1.5s ease-in-out infinite,ctaPulse 2s ease-in-out infinite,ctaShine 3s linear infinite\">QUIERO SABER MÁS <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\"><path d=\"M0 256C0 397.4 114.6 512 256 512s256-114.6 256-256S397.4 0 256 0S0 114.6 0 256zm395.3 11.3l-112 112c-4.6 4.6-11.5 5.9-17.4 3.5s-9.9-8.3-9.9-14.8l0-64-96 0c-17.7 0-32-14.3-32-32l0-32c0-17.7 14.3-32 32-32l96 0 0-64c0-6.5 3.9-12.3 9.9-14.8s12.9-1.1 17.4 3.5l112 112c6.2 6.2 6.2 16.4 0 22.6z\"/></svg></a></p>\n<h2 style=\"margin:16px 0 8px;font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700\">Información</h2>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:32px;margin-bottom:20px;padding-left:0.75rem\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-wallet\" style=\"color:#84C002;font-size:1.7rem;flex-shrink:0;line-height:1;align-self:center;min-width:2rem;text-align:center\"></i>\n  <div style=\"flex:1\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;\"><strong>Gestión de Rutinas</strong></p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.6;\">La plataforma organiza horarios de alimentación, paseos y medicación de forma inteligente, evitando cualquier olvido.</p></div></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:32px;margin-bottom:20px;padding-left:0.75rem\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-mobile-screen\" style=\"color:#84C002;font-size:1.7rem;flex-shrink:0;line-height:1;align-self:center;min-width:2rem;text-align:center\"></i>\n  <div style=\"flex:1\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;\"><strong>Seguimiento de Salud</strong></p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.6;\">Monitorea los datos vitales de tu mascota y genera informes útiles para futuras consultas veterinarias.</p></div></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:32px;margin-bottom:20px;padding-left:0.75rem\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-clock\" style=\"color:#84C002;font-size:1.7rem;flex-shrink:0;line-height:1;align-self:center;min-width:2rem;text-align:center\"></i>\n  <div style=\"flex:1\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;\"><strong>Asesoramiento Experto</strong></p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.6;\">Accede a profesionales veterinarios calificados para resolver dudas rápidas o emergencias menores en línea.</p></div></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:32px;margin-bottom:20px;padding-left:0.75rem\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-calendar-check\" style=\"color:#84C002;font-size:1.7rem;flex-shrink:0;line-height:1;align-self:center;min-width:2rem;text-align:center\"></i>\n  <div style=\"flex:1\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;\"><strong>Alimentación Optimizada</strong></p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.6;\">Recibe recomendaciones personalizadas de dietas y porciones según la raza, edad y actividad de tu animal.</p></div></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:32px;margin-bottom:20px;padding-left:0.75rem\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-car\" style=\"color:#84C002;font-size:1.7rem;flex-shrink:0;line-height:1;align-self:center;min-width:2rem;text-align:center\"></i>\n  <div style=\"flex:1\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;\"><strong>Comunidad y Soporte</strong></p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.6;\">Conéctate con otros dueños de mascotas para compartir experiencias y consejos valiosos en un entorno seguro.</p></div></div>\n<p style=\"margin:18px 0 14px\"><a href=\"/p/tetse-la-innovacion-para-el-bienestar-de-tu-mascota\" class=\"thecta\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:0.35em;padding:1.1em 1.4em;background:linear-gradient(110deg,#84C002 40%,#96d214 50%,#84C002 60%);background-size:200% 100%;color:#fff;border-radius:16px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.8px;width:100%;font-size:30px;text-decoration:none;line-height:1;min-height:64px;animation:ctaBounce 1.5s ease-in-out infinite,ctaPulse 2s ease-in-out infinite,ctaShine 3s linear infinite\">QUIERO SABER MÁS <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\"><path d=\"M0 256C0 397.4 114.6 512 256 512s256-114.6 256-256S397.4 0 256 0S0 114.6 0 256zm395.3 11.3l-112 112c-4.6 4.6-11.5 5.9-17.4 3.5s-9.9-8.3-9.9-14.8l0-64-96 0c-17.7 0-32-14.3-32-32l0-32c0-17.7 14.3-32 32-32l96 0 0-64c0-6.5 3.9-12.3 9.9-14.8s12.9-1.1 17.4 3.5l112 112c6.2 6.2 6.2 16.4 0 22.6z\"/></svg></a></p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:16px 0 8px;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-thumbs-up\" style=\"color:#84C002;font-size:1.8rem;flex-shrink:0\"></i><h3 style=\"margin:0;font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;\">Puntos positivos a destacar</h3></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:35px;margin-bottom:20px;padding-left:0.75rem;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\" style=\"color:#84C002;font-size:1.5rem;flex-shrink:0\"></i>\n  <div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;\"><strong>Conveniencia total</strong></p>\n    <p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-size:0.93rem;\">Centraliza toda la información de tu mascota.</p></div></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:35px;margin-bottom:20px;padding-left:0.75rem;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\" style=\"color:#84C002;font-size:1.5rem;flex-shrink:0\"></i>\n  <div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;\"><strong>Soporte profesional</strong></p>\n    <p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-size:0.93rem;\">Acceso rápido a veterinarios expertos.</p></div></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:35px;margin-bottom:20px;padding-left:0.75rem;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\" style=\"color:#84C002;font-size:1.5rem;flex-shrink:0\"></i>\n  <div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;\"><strong>Salud preventiva</strong></p>\n    <p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-size:0.93rem;\">Facilita el monitoreo constante.</p></div></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:35px;margin-bottom:20px;padding-left:0.75rem;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\" style=\"color:#84C002;font-size:1.5rem;flex-shrink:0\"></i>\n  <div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;\"><strong>Rutina organizada</strong></p>\n    <p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-size:0.93rem;\">Simplifica las tareas diarias.</p></div></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:35px;margin-bottom:20px;padding-left:0.75rem;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\" style=\"color:#84C002;font-size:1.5rem;flex-shrink:0\"></i>\n  <div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;\"><strong>Personalización</strong></p>\n    <p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-size:0.93rem;\">Adapta el cuidado a cada mascota.</p></div></div>\n<p style=\"margin:18px 0 14px\"><a href=\"/p/tetse-la-innovacion-para-el-bienestar-de-tu-mascota\" class=\"thecta\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-c